      "side": 1,
      "message": "And based on Sanyo and Panasonic spec, there\u0027s might chance that D-FET is on and C-FET is off(full charge).\nMight cause battery not in cutoff mode, but still recognize in cutoff.\nI still think we should only use D-FET status to identify \"battery was in cutoff mode\". After all this is used to avoid system power on when battery can\u0027t discharge.",
      "revId": "03413df47d28801f016c64262a3a3caa2e7218fe",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
