      "writtenOn": "2017-09-08T16:36:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is from the Sony battery spec of page 8:\n2.1 Smart Battery Data Definition\nb15,b14 (read only bits): FET Status\n00: Charge FET \u003d on, Discharge FET \u003d on\n01: Charge FET \u003d off, Discharge FET \u003d on\n10: Charge FET \u003d off, Discharge FET \u003d off\n11: Charge FET \u003d on, Discharge FET \u003d off\n\nI had misread the Sony definition and had the polarity and bit position. The 4 values seem to make it impossible to determine the status of the Charge FET from a single bit.",
      "parentUuid": "22178112_158cabbb",
      "revId": "03413df47d28801f016c64262a3a3caa2e7218fe",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
